ving a mixed state (us-east on v2.3.0, the other two regions still on v2.3.1).\n2. Retried the rollback \u2014 it completed successfully in all three regions.\n3. Verified: all regions now on v2.3.0, `healthy: true`, error rate 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) describing the failure, the rollback including the partial failure and retry, the current healthy state, and follow-ups (root-cause v2.3.1 before redeploying; investigate the orchestrator error). The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it was created, so I didn't retry.", "type": "text"}]}]}